 urated-by-inna-faliks-3/\n\nMusic/Words LA closes its second season at th
 e Wende with the US premiere of Janáček’s sonata for violin and piano
  in its early\, unpublished version. Czech violinist Pavel Šporcl makes 
 a rare Los Angeles appearance with pianist Inna Faliks in an all-Czech pr
 ogram of 20th-century music that marks the release of their recording on 
 the Pentatone label. Works by Martinů\, Dvořák\, Suk\, Bodorová\, and
  Gid
